notes.content:
Patch includes the following adjustments:

[list]
[*] Adjusted colliders in elevator shaft preventing player falling outside of the game world (prison block);
[*] Fixed teleportation position into the death room - a fully fixed-teleport that prevents the player being too far away from the continue/quit orbs;
[*] Tweaked computer positions on desks to be closer to the edge, to alleviate the auto-pushback (prison block);
[*] Adjusted the holster's so that it should be easier to select an item the player wishes to take;
[*] Fixed a German decal to ensure it would turn on correctly when required (offices).
[/list]

Patch notes include:

[list]
[*] Removed graphical lighting artifacts on some geometry across all levels;
[*] Adjusted some geometry colliders;
[*] Improved lighting in some key points of interest.
[/list]
